          "text": "Usho kanje uJehova Sebawoti, uthi: “Ukuzila ukudla kwenyanga yesine, nokuzila ukudla kweyesihlanu, nokuzila ukudla kweyesikhombisa, nokuzila ukudla kweyeshumi kuyakuba ngukuthokoza nokujabula nemikhosi yokujabula endlini yakwaJuda; ngakho-ke kufanele uthande iqiniso nokuthula.",
